    "notes": [
      "BB-1 (high): assets/inc/buddypress-birthdays-widget.php:81,84 echo $args['before_widget'] / before_title + esc_html(title) + $args['after_title'] are emitted with EscapeOutput suppressed. before/after_widget/title come from register_sidebar and are trusted, but the line 84 concatenation mixes trusted wrappers with escaped title — acceptable, flagged for awareness.",
